      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Konfigurasi Kamus Bidang (Body Config)",
      "id": "details-body-config",
      "intro": "Sub-tab Body Config merupakan pusat definisi kamus data ISO8583 (Bit Fields). Di sini, pengguna mendefinisikan tipe data, panjang, dan metode encoding untuk setiap bidang data ISO 8583 (field 1 - 128) yang digunakan di dalam sistem.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Daftar & Detail Kamus Bidang ISO",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tabel menampilkan semua daftar bidang (Bit Fields) ISO8583 yang telah didaftarkan.\n• Kolom tabel menampilkan:\n  - **Field Number:** Nomor bidang standar ISO8583 (contoh: 2 untuk PAN, 3 untuk Processing Code, 4 untuk Amount).\n  - **Description:** Deskripsi fungsi bidang tersebut.\n  - **Length:** Panjang bidang data.\n  - **Data Type:** Tipe data bidang (contoh: `NUMERIC`, `ALPHANUMERIC`, `ALPHA`).\n  - **Encoding Type:** Metode penyandian bidang (contoh: `ASCII`, `BINARY`, `EBCDIC`).\n• Gunakan tombol pencarian untuk memfilter berdasarkan Nomor Bidang atau Deskripsi.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(99,102,241,.08);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#eef2ff;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#1e1b4b;\">Body Config</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#6366f1;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add</span></div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9px;\"><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Field</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Type</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Len</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Encoding</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#1e1b4b;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">2 - PAN</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(99,102,241,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">NUMERIC</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#64748b;\">19</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(20,184,166,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0d9488;\">ASCII</span></td></tr></table></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Form Tambah / Edit Body Field",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nForm drawer berukuran **480px** menyediakan field berikut:\n1. **Iso Field Number** *(Wajib)*: Nomor bidang ISO 8583 yang valid (0-128).\n2. **Description** *(Wajib)*: Penjelasan fungsi atau nama bidang data tersebut.\n3. **Length** *(Wajib)*: Batas panjang karakter/byte maksimal bidang tersebut.\n4. **Data Type** *(Wajib)*: Tipe data bidang — pilih dari opsi tipe data ISO (seperti `Numeric`, `Alpha`, `Alphanumeric`, dll).\n5. **Encoding Type** *(Wajib)*: Tipe encoding yang digunakan — pilih dari `ASCII`, `BINARY`, `EBCDIC`, dll.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(99,102,241,.12);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#e0e7ff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#6366f1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 3v18M3 12h18\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#1e1b4b;\">Create Body Field</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#6366f1;\">Fill details and save changes</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:9.5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Iso Field Number <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#1e1b4b;font-size:9px;\">2</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Length <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#1e1b4b;font-size:9px;\">19</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Description <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Primary Account Number (PAN)</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Data Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Numeric</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Encoding Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">ASCII</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#6366f1;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
